  <h1>Privacy Policy for PH Flood Control Project</h1>
  <p><strong>App Name:</strong> PH Flood Control Project</p>
  <p><strong>Developer:</strong> JCDC</p>

  <p>PH Flood Control Project respects your privacy. This app does <strong>not collect, store, or share any personal data or user information</strong>.</p>

  <h2>Information Collection & Permissions</h2>
  <p>PH Flood Control Project does <strong>not</strong> collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Personal information (e.g., name, email address, phone number)</li>
    <li>Device identifiers or usage tracking data</li>
    <li>Cookies or user profiling data</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Location Access:</strong> The app may request access to your device's location (precise and approximate) solely to show your current location on the map and calculate distances to nearby flood control projects. Location data is processed exclusively on your device in real-time and is <strong>never</strong> transmitted to external servers, logged, or shared.</p>

  <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>Since we do not collect or store any personal data, there is nothing to sell, distribute, or share with third parties.</p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>PH Flood Control Project does not collect data from any users, including children under the age of 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>Although unlikely, we may update this Privacy Policy if the app's functionality changes in the future. Any updates will be posted on this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, feel free to contact us at:<br>
  <strong>Email:</strong> [your-email@example.com]</p>

